  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A string is fixed at both ends. P and Q are two particles on the string.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The first harmonic standing wave is formed in the string. What is correct about the motion of P and Q?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">P is a node and Q is an antinode.</li><li data-label=\"B\">P is an antinode and Q is a node.</li><li data-label=\"C\">P and Q oscillate with the same amplitude.</li><li data-label=\"D\">P and Q oscillate with the same frequency.</li></ol>"
  },
